{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_st01","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":1,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-ST-1","storyName":"陈皮菊花茶","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"四十年前，真龙去世的消息使得整个炎国上下震动。在晚春的雨夜，匆匆离开百灶城的，有一位皇子，还有一位携家带口的书生。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_st01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_st01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"next":1,"characters":["吆喝的伙计","沉稳的男性","朔","？？？","太傅","太尉","帷幕后的声音","侍从","温柔的女性","仓皇的男人","车夫","惊慌的女性","沉默的老人","满手血污的人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_bg_bg_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act13d0d0/m_sys_midautumn20.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chess","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"先生是说，大炎历史上当真有这么一位奇人？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"是......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"收录书卷，整理文字，推广教育......为何她为天下苍生做了这么多事，却没有人记得她，甚至没有人知道她的名字？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_penrustle","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":17},{"type":"subtitle","text":"先生，这是什么字？我似乎从来没有见过？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":18},{"type":"subtitle","text":"并非无人记得“她”，只是她的一字真名，没有被史书记录在册。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":19},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这样岂不可惜？明明她的笔写下了炎国悠久的历史，写遍了炎国万里的山河，可史书中没有一页留下了她的名字......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":20},{"type":"subtitle","text":"您说......如果我把这些史书尽数补全，能从中还原出她的模样吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":21},{"type":"subtitle","id":22},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":23},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":24},{"type":"sticker","id":25,"text":"四十年前","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":26,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":27},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.4","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainheavy_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":30},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":31},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","id":32},{"type":"animtext","id":33,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1062年4月21日    谷雨</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":34},{"type":"animtextclean","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowswalk","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":38},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吆喝的伙计","text":"客人，客人！","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吆喝的伙计","text":"这么大的雨，进来喝壶热茶，避避雨再走吧。","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的男性","text":"不必了。这场雨眼看着一时半刻也停不下来，还是快些赶路吧。","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吆喝的伙计","text":"哈哈，有人盼着这场雨停下，可还有人盼着它多下一阵哩。","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吆喝的伙计","text":"卖伞的商贩笑开花，就是愁死了赶路人。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的男性","text":"阁下说的话倒是有趣......","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吆喝的伙计","text":"客人还是歇歇脚吧。有人托我嘱咐您，前路坑洼不好走，怕您踏错沾湿了鞋。","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉稳的男性","text":"嗯......？","id":47},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":49},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吆喝的伙计","text":"客人，这边请吧，要见您的那位已经在里面等着了。","id":52},{"type":"dialog","id":53},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":54},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":55,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.15","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"尚书大人......好久不见。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"不，现在应该称......太傅。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.5","duration":"1","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"玉门一别，的确很久不见了。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"我以为这次回京述职，应该要先见司岁台和兵部才对。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"所以我才赶在那之前来见你一面。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......陛下驾崩了。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":73},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.5","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"何时......？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"半月前。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"我想......如果陛下是寿终正寝，太傅也不会专程来见我。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"难道......","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"200,0","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"坐在阴影中的人伸出手，他的掌心，正躺着一枚黑色云子。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......！","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"六十年前，他逃离了那座古寺，将自己化作一百八十一颗黑子，分散各地，至今下落不明。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"而就在半月前，司岁台在京城发现了这一枚黑子的踪迹。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......他做了什么？","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"尚不知晓......","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"唯一可以确定的是，他绝无可能进入禁城......应是有人主动见了他。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"这个人的身份，不方便去查。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"他想做的事，按理不该牵扯到旁人才是......","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"今天我本不该见你。可当初那个罪人引起动乱时，毕竟是你亲手将他制服的。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......宗师，对此事你知道什么吗？","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......并无所知。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"那次事故之后，我也没有再见过他。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"那我相信宗师。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"需要我做些什么吗？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"不要停留，即刻返回玉门。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"乌萨斯动荡不断，玉门守将新旧交替，这个时间，切不可再使人心动荡。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"司岁台与兵部，我自会处理。你不在局中，我才能以重任相托。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......明白。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"棋局之事，我会让司岁台暗中继续查下去。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"特殊时期，宗师不便再露面——你可以当今日没有见过我。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"真龙他究竟是......炎武殿下还好吗？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"这个时候，他应该——","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"炎武......","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"陛下去世的那天晚上，是炎武去见了他。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"0.3","id":133},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2.5","id":134},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":138},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_58_g5_dragonpalace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":141},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":142,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"0.5","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-30","duration":"0.3","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"启禀殿下，那叛臣一族二十八人皆已收监。","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"可核对名录时发现，其家中本应有一个尚不满月的婴儿——","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"但是禁军今天在太师府中搜查时，将整个宅子翻了个底朝天，也没有找到那婴儿的下落。","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"......一个还在襁褓里的孩子，总不会是自己逃走的。","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"还是有人惦记着她。","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"殿下不必烦扰，禁军会找到她。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"哼......","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"今天早些时候，刑部尚书求见。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"这一系列的案子，到底该怎么审怎么办，他想征求殿下的意见。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"......依炎律审。","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"我会转告他。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"我的那位兄长，现在到何处了？","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"据守军报告，半个时辰前刚出京城。有部分禁军，追随他叛逃。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"守城士兵未得军令，不敢阻拦。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"是啊......我的确没有下过要将他留在百灶的命令。","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"是他不愿意留下，弃了所有人而去了。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"跟着他走的禁军......有多少人？","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"十八人。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"我这位兄长，就算犯下了这样的滔天罪行，还是可以让太师替他赴死，还是可以让这十八死士愿意追随他而去。","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"这满朝文武，还有多少人的心在他那里？有多少人，还在盼望他回来坐这个位置？","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#2$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"可如今，是殿下在这个位置。让炎国万世昌宁的责任，也在殿下身上。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"炎国上下，任谁都可以心思徘徊，犹疑不定......唯独殿下您不行。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"......","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"我有许久没有走出这座宫殿了......太尉，告诉我——","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"百灶的这场春雨，停了吗？","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"只要殿下想，这场雨就可以停下。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"......若殿下改了主意，还来得及将他们留下。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"......","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"......乏了。","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"侍从","text":"御膳司备了些八宝攒汤和水笋丝，殿下可要用点？","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"起菜吧。","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"......","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":200},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":201},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":202},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":203},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":206},{"type":"charslot","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainheavy_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":209},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":210},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","id":211},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_rain","layer":"1","id":212},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":213},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":214},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":215},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.1","fadetime":"0.1","id":216},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carriage_loop","loop":"true","channel":"b","volume":"0","id":217},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"b","fadetime":"2","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":221,"musicid":3},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_babycry_loop","loop":"true","channel":"a","volume":"0","id":222},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":223},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":224},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"5","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的女性","text":"乖......乖......","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温柔的女性","text":"不哭不哭，我们回家去......就快要到家了......","id":227},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"2","id":228},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"再快些......劳驾，麻烦您再快些......","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"这么大的雨，路都看不清，不能再快啦......","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#8$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"离下一个驿站还有多远？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"怎么也得三十里地吧......","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"这位兄弟，您是有多要紧的事......拖家带口的，怎么就偏挑这么个晚上赶路啊？","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#4$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"......","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#2$1","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"......请快些吧。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2d/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":244},{"type":"charslot","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1634_1#1$1","bstart":"0.3","bend":"0.9","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"啊......！啊！什么东西——","id":253},{"type":"dialog","id":254},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"3","id":255},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcknmgrwl","id":256},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":258},{"type":"curtain","fadetime":"1","id":259},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"见鬼了！这荒郊野外的，怎么还有活人啊......","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#7$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"......","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":264},{"type":"text","text":"男人四下张望，绵延不绝的雨幕遮住了视线，夜色茫茫，什么都看不到。","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#5$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"不可以再乘车了......","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_goldcoin","volume":"0.5","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"劳驾，这些钱都留给您。请把车驶到前面的驿站去，要是有人问起的话，千万不要说今晚拉过带着孩子的客人。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"在下拜谢先生......","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"可是......这，唉！","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"车夫","text":"这么大的雨，您要上哪去啊？","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#3$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"从小路走......穿过北边的林子——","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":276},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女性","text":"啊——！","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#8$1","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"怎么了——","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女性","text":"孩子......","id":282},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的女性","text":"孩子不见了......","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1616_1#6$1","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仓皇的男人","text":"——！","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1616_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"charslot","id":291},{"type":"bgeffect","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":293},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3f/Avg_bg_25_g11_yanroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":294},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":296},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act13d0d0/m_sys_midautumn20.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":297,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的老人","text":"......","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的老人","text":"这就是......那个孩子。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"text","text":"襁褓中的婴儿睡得香甜，脸蛋上沾染了泥污与血污也浑然不觉。","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","focus":"n","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"您交代我办的事，我都已经办成了......","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"他们的手段，我都清楚，也知道该怎么应付。大人不必担忧，我绝不会让半点血沾在您的身上。","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的老人","text":"先生大义......老朽无以为报。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"不......您不该谢我，我不是为您才做这件事的。","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"那位大人曾有大恩于我。我做的这件事，却不能为她洗净冤屈，甚至连为她报仇都谈不上。","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"我没有亲人，不用操心身后事。想拜托大人的，也就只有这一件事。","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"大人......请您收养这个孩子吧。","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#3$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的老人","text":"这......","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"您不必告诉她什么，只要让她平安长大，安稳地活过这一辈子就好了。","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的老人","text":"......你知道，她留在这，就多一分风险，多一分将这桩旧案重新翻出来的可能。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"可这难道不是您盼望的吗？","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"时势使然，现在我们注定无可奈何。","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"可是总有一天，不管三十年也好，四十年也好......只要有朝一日，真相能大白于天下......","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"满手血污的人","text":"这些血......就不算白流。","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#2$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的老人","text":"......","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沉默的老人","text":"好，我答应你。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":332},{"type":"image","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334}],"characters":["吆喝的伙计","沉稳的男性","朔","？？？","太傅","太尉","帷幕后的声音","侍从","温柔的女性","仓皇的男人","车夫","惊慌的女性","沉默的老人","满手血污的人"]}